  "FD_rules": [
    "central (J(+h)-J(-h))/(2*h) in worker dtype; retain both objectives, actual perturbed input/alpha, q, dt, h, effective dtypes and returned fit arrays from EACH composition invocation",
    "all declared FD steps vs AD in both modes; float32 every adjacent pair in descending h order; float64 singleton has no adjacent pair (explicit not_applicable)",
    "input fixed-fit objective is quadratic: real-arithmetic central-FD truncation error is ZERO, not O(h^2); floating input/objective/FD arithmetic remains unbounded by this gate",
    "O(h^2)+O(u/h) is only a smooth-order heuristic; projected-fit kinks and coefficient active-set transitions are not covered. Retain final coefficient-zero pattern per branch as a limited diagnostic; change/nonfinite/unresolved comparison => preserve and stop, no retune",
    "scope x64 off/on outside JIT for float32/float64 respectively and restore; assert actual input, strong alpha/dt/h/q/perturbations, fit arrays, output, objective, input cotangent and order cotangent dtypes; scalar order cotangent shape []",
    "every eager/JIT/AD/FD composition returns actual fit arrays via aux from fit->apply+scale; exact D_hat/reference/analytic gradient use THAT mode and branch arrays. Never borrow eager fit arrays for JIT; no claim that public SOE wrapper has instrumentation"
  ]
